  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-358 Talon is a heavy pistol that fires two explosive rounds simultaneously, converting the conventional pistol format into a point-blank scatter weapon. The paired detonations punch through kinetic barriers and spread shrapnel across a wide arc, making precise aim less critical than pointing it in the right direction. Mercenaries who operate in close-quarters corridors favor it for exactly that forgiving quality - in a tight space, the Talon rarely misses anything.</p>"
